    "text": "<p>Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>·</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, using limit as a sum integral we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>·</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>4</mn></m